Alembic migrations for the Relayna Studio PostgreSQL control-plane database.

Create future revisions from studio/backend with:

    RELAYNA_STUDIO_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://... uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Review every generated operation before committing it. The application applies
the bundled chain to head during startup, before readiness and background
workers. Startup and explicit Alembic commands serialize under the same
PostgreSQL transaction advisory lock. The database role needs migration DDL
privileges. Explicit pre-deployment upgrades remain optional; back up before
schema upgrades and coordinate versions that expect different schema heads.
